      "id": "claim_a1b800bfe4ab4ffea386db099584a3e2",
      "statement": "Master election is transport-specific: Local mode uses a deterministic Unix Domain Socket in a per-user private runtime directory ($XDG_RUNTIME_DIR/oifs or /tmp/oifs-<uid>/oifs) with mode 0600 socket and 0600 token file, Network mode uses an atomic create_new rendezvous .master file plus a clock-free active Ping/Pong probe to detect a dead master.",
