      "id": "claim_abd2acc47e284609888bda30b3e701e2",
      "statement": "canonicalize_path follows up to 32 symbolic link hops even for files not yet created on disk, ensuring concurrent threads opening distinct symlinks targeting the same image resolve to identical canonical registry keys without split-brain.",
